iterations.reply:
I've removed the enrichment fetch. The component can only link interfaces the node's `with` clause grants, and that is checked against the current graph definition. A promise of a future grant isn't enough, so any build that imports `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0` will be rejected the same way. Once your release adds `HTTPClient<[metadata.internal.example]>` to `SummariseItem`'s `with` clause, the fetch can go back in. The node's output was never meant to depend on the enrichment record, so removing it changes nothing in what the node returns.

